<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2010 bond yields 6.53 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2010 bond yields 6.53 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/95 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office on Thursday:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-10-2010</p>
<p> COUPON:				 8.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.53 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  115.20</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 260 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 405 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES: The previous auction of the bond raised 150 million markka at a price of 112.40 and a yield of 6.83 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 3,613 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
